@771 = ~Elemental Barrier~
@772 = ~Elemental Barrier (Abjuration)
Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The elemental barrier grants 5% per level (max 100%) resistance to all elemental attacks: fire, cold, acid and electricity, whether magical or natural: spells, weapons, wands, breath weapons, etc. The effects last until the spell expires or is dispelled.~
@77219 = ~Elemental Barrier (Abjuration)
Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The elemental barrier grants 100% resistance to all elemental attacks: fire, cold, acid and electricity, whether magical or natural: spells, weapons, wands, breath weapons, etc. The effects last until the spell expires or is dispelled.~
@77220 = ~Elemental Barrier (Abjuration)
Level: 7
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

The elemental barrier grants 100% resistance to all elemental attacks: fire, cold, acid and electricity, whether magical or natural: spells, weapons, wands, breath weapons, etc. The effects last until the spell expires or is dispelled.~
@772201 = ~Elemental Barrier (Abjuration)
Level: 7
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

The elemental barrier grants 100% resistance to all elemental attacks: fire, cold, acid and electricity, whether magical or natural: spells, weapons, wands, breath weapons, etc. The effects last until the spell expires or is dispelled.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: they receive 66% resistance to elements for 2 turns.~

@773 = ~Major Elemental Shield~
@774 = ~Major Elemental Shield (Evocation)
Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round / level
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the warlord to be covered by a full elemental shield, granting him 30% + 3% per level (max 90%) resistance to the chosen element as well as a backlash ability of 2D8 +2 points of damage to anyone who hits him. The shield also grants other abilities, which vary according to its nature.
- Fire:
Burning Flame: The shield takes the shape of a great flame that releases an intense heat.
Every round, all creatures within 2-meter radius will suffer 2D8 points of fire damage.
Flare: any opponent struck by the backlash must make a successful saving throw at -2 or will burn for 5 rounds: in this case he will suffer diminishing damage as follows: 2D10 +5, 2D8 +4, 2D6 +3, 2D4 +2, 2D2 +1. As long as he burns, he cannot suffer backlash damage (the first 3 rounds) and cannot flare up again.
Fire creatures (salamander, elemental, etc.) cannot flare up.
- Cold:
Crystallization: the skin of the protected mage will turn into ice and partially crystallize: base AC set to 7 and 25% slashing and piercing damage resistance.
Freezing Aura: any creature that remains more than 3 seconds within 3 meters from the mage is automatically slowed for the current round: -20% to movement speed and -2 to attack rolls.
Freeze: any opponent struck by the backlash must make a successful saving throw at -2 or freezes on the spot, turning into an inert block for 5 rounds. Then he is immune to almost all attacks (crushing attacks still deal half damage) but is unable to take any action and suffers 1D6 +2 cumulative points of cold damage per round until the ice disappears.
- Electricity:
Electricity Globe: the shield takes the shape of a large globe. Every round, it inflicts 4D6 points of damage to the creatures in its radius. A save vs. spell at -2 halves the damage.
Electric Shock: Any opponent struck by the backlash must make a successful save vs. spell at -2 or will suffer quadruple damage (8D8 +8) and a shock that stuns him for 1 round and imposes a -2 penalty to all rolls for the following 2 rounds. Penalties of electric shocks do not stack.
- Acid:
Acid Bubble: the shield takes the shape of a bubble of boiling droplets. The humidity of this envelope provides additional 50% protection against fire. It extends up to cover the weapon held by the mage, which adds 2D4 points of acid damage to its hits.
Spatter: The backlash has a 50% chance of becoming a large splash that deals 8d8+8 points of damage. A save vs. spell halves the damage. On a failed save, acid covers the victim and continues to corrode it for 3 rounds, dealing diminishing damage: 6D6 +6, 4D4 +4, then 2D2 +2. During this time, the pain imposes -2 to THAC0 and -1 to Dexterity.

Only 1 major elemental shield can be active at a time.~
@7741 = ~Freezing~
@7742 = ~Major Elemental Shield (Evocation)
Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the warlord to be covered by a full elemental shield, granting him 90% resistance to the chosen element as well as a backlash ability of 2D8 +2 points of damage to anyone who hits him. The shield also grants other abilities, which vary according to its nature.
