@7715 = ~Execution~
@7716 = ~Execution (Necromancy)
Level: 7
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: negates

This cruel spell kills with a glance. In a humanoid, the heart fails; in an aberration or monster, another vital organ is destroyed. A failed save at -2 means death. If the saving throw is successful, metabolic shock suffered by the target still inflicts 4D8 points of damage. Execution cannot kill the undead, artificial creatures and certain powers of other planes, but all these creatures may still succumb after the damage inflicted by the spell.~
@77161 = ~Execution (Necromancy)
Level: 7
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: negates

This cruel spell kills with a glance. In a humanoid, the heart fails; in an aberration or monster, another vital organ is destroyed. A failed save at -2 means death. If the saving throw is successful, metabolic shock suffered by the target still inflicts 4D8 points of damage. Execution cannot kill the undead, artificial creatures and certain powers of other planes, but all these creatures may still succumb after the damage inflicted by the spell.~

@7717 = ~Antimagic Globe~
@7718 = ~Antimagic Globe (Abjuration)
Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round / level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates around the spellcaster a protective globe inside which no magic can act. When the globe is created, all the magic that acts on the subject is dissipated immediately. Thereafter, no magic can penetrate the globe, or act inside. While the globe is active, the protected creature is immune to all magic but cannot cast spells of its own.

If the spellcaster is protected by a Lasting Magic spell at the moment when Antimagic Globe is cast, dispelling is negated by Lasting Magic, which absorbs all energy before disappearing, leaving the other ongoing magic effects active.~
@77181 = ~Antimagic Globe (Abjuration)
Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates around the spellcaster a protective globe inside which no magic can act. When the globe is created, all the magic that acts on the subject is dissipated immediately. Thereafter, no magic can penetrate the globe, or act inside. While the globe is active, the protected creature is immune to all magic but cannot cast spells of its own.

