Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This powerful healing spell allows the recipient to recover from all diseases and injuries. All his afflictions are healed and all lost hit points are restored.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: they recover 75% of their base hit points and have a 66% chance to get rid of other afflictions.~

@7721 = ~Acid Rain~
@7722 = ~Acid Rain (Evocation)
Level: 7
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 round / level
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: special

This spell sends a rain of magic gelatinous acid droplets at the targeted area. All creatures within the area of effect are covered by drops of this substance. Acid stays for 1 round per level of the warlord and then evaporates.
Creatures covered like that will suffer 1D4 points of damage per round for rounds 1 to 3, then 1D6 per round for rounds 4 to 6 and 1D8 each subsequent round. Characters who have succeeded at the first round a save vs. spell will suffer only half acid damage for the following rounds. The effects end when the spell expires.~
@77221 = ~Acid Rain (Evocation)
Level: 7
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: special

This spell sends a rain of magic gelatinous acid droplets at the targeted area. All creatures within the area of effect are covered by drops of this substance. Acid stays for 1 round per level of the warlord and then evaporates.
Creatures covered like that will suffer 1D4 points of damage per round for rounds 1 to 3, then 1D6 per round for rounds 4 to 6 and 1D8 each subsequent round. Characters who have succeeded at the first round a save vs. spell will suffer only half acid damage for the following rounds. The effects end when the spell expires.~

@7723 = ~Lava Spikes~
@7724 = ~Lava Spikes (Evocation)
Level: 7
Range: caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: half

When the spell is complete, the warlord sends spikes of molten lava in every direction. Every creature within the area around him is affected by one spike per level of the warlord. Each one inflicts 1D4 piercing damage and 1 point of fire damage (max 20D4 +20). Creatures that make a successful saving throw receive only half damage.~
@77241 = ~Lava Spikes (Evocation)
Level: 7
Range: caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: half

When the spell is complete, the warlord sends spikes of molten lava in every direction. Every creature within the area around him is affected by the equivalent of twenty spikes. Each one inflicts 1D4 piercing damage and 1 point of fire damage. Creatures that make a successful saving throw receive only half damage.~

@7725 = ~Lasting Magic~
@7726 = ~Lasting Magic (Abjuration)
Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The warlord developed this spell after the frustration of seeing his preparations for battle undone by a single enemy dispel.
The spell creates a shield made up of energy that opposes dispelling magic. This shield absorbs all attempts of dispelling, allowing the warlord's spells to last for their full duration.

Be careful though: as a result of this protection, the caster can also no longer be affected by "Dispel Magic", which can be dangerous if he is affected by harmful magical effects.~
